stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>\u222a</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\u221e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are positive in these regions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The only slope field that satisfies the above conditions is the following.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-7433fcc6203a83fe480b2ff8ce9b7e9e\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/7433fcc6203a83fe480b2ff8ce9b7e9e\"></div> \n</div></div>",
